Scenario: Add Wiki Front Page Child Page Format HTML
Priority: 4
	Given these properties
		|portal.acceptance|quarantine|
	When these variables
		|welcomeToLiferay||
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiPage add Front Page PG
		|wikiPageContent|Wiki FrontPage Content|
	And WikiNavigator goto PG
		|wikiPageTitle|FrontPage|
	And AssertClick assert Text Click At And Pause the value 'Add Child Page' at locator 'Link#ADD_CHILD_PAGE'
	And WikiEntry select Page Format
		|pageFormat|HTML|
	And WikiEntry confirm HTML
	And WikiEntry add Page Title
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_EDITOR_SWITCH_ACE_EDITOR'
	And Type type Ace Editor the value '${welcomeToLiferay}' at locator 'TextArea#ACE_EDITOR'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto Child Page PG
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
	Then WikiPage view Child Page PG
		|wikiChildPageContent|Welcome to LIFERAY|
		|wikiChildPageTitle|Wiki FrontPage Child Page Title|
