		|portlet|App Manager|
	And Search search CP
		|searchTerm|Creole|
	And these variables
		|key_appName|Creole|
	And these variables
		|key_appStatus|Resolved|
	And AssertTextEquals assert Partial Text the value 'Resolved' at locator 'AppManager#APP_STATUS'
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Wiki Test Page|
	And WikiNavigator goto All Pages PG
	And WikiNavigator goto Add Page Via PG
	And WikiEntry add Page Title
		|wikiPageTitle|Wiki Page With JSPWiki Content|
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_FIELD'
	And Click at locator 'AlloyEditor#CONTENT_EDITOR_SWITCH_ACE_EDITOR'
	And Type send Keys Ace Editor the value '!JSPWiki Header' at locator 'TextArea#ACE_EDITOR'
	And KeyPress the value '\RETURN' at locator 'TextArea#ACE_EDITOR'
	And Type send Keys Ace Editor the value '__JSPWiki Bold Text__' at locator 'TextArea#ACE_EDITOR'
	And PortletEntry publish
	And Navigator goto Page
